#. 今日はまだ…時間があるな。
#. これからどうしよう…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's still some time left in the day. What to\n"
"do...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これも、壊したら…罰があるのかもな…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If I break it...Monokuma might come and punish *me*."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. こんなカメラで…人が死ぬところも見てるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera. Someone's using these cameras\n"
"to watch people die...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>無視だ、無視…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just ignore it... Ignore it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの死から…目を背けちゃいけない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't let myself turn away from Sayaka's death...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの為にも…
#. ボク自身の為にもだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For Sayaka...and for myself...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても、この鉄板…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This damn metal plate..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ただ窓をふさぐにしては…
#. ちょっと大げさすぎないか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All this, just to block off the window? It seems like\n"
"overkill...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても、この鉄板…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This damn metal plate..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ただ窓をふさぐにしては…
#. ちょっと大げさすぎないか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All this, just to block off the window? It seems like\n"
"overkill...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>メモ帳がある。
#. でも、メモるような事がない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the same notepad from before. I don't need to\n"
"write anything down right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>たまには掃除くらいしようかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should start cleaning up once in a while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビニールの包装がされてる。
#. まだ未開封の新品だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It still hasn't been opened.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まぁ、工具セットなんて使う事はないだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I don't think I need it right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0017 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0018 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間もあるし、少し休もうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have some time, so maybe I should take a little\n"
"rest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うっかり、捨てちゃまずい物を
#. 入れたりしてないよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I haven't accidentally thrown away anything I\n"
"shouldn't have, have I...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>紙は、はがしたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I tore the paper off the wall, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの内容を思い出すだけでも、
#. 嫌な気分になる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...just remembering what it said still makes me feel\n"
"queasy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しのある机だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the same desk with the same few drawers.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>よくある一般的な机だな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the kind of thing any student would have.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0025 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0026 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
